            </note>
            <note corresp="#d149-f4" n="3" xml:id="d149-f4-content">
                <p>In the telegrams referred to Hurley had
                    discussed British and French colonialism in Asia, the possible return of Hong
                    Kong to China, a possible trusteeship for Indochina, problems of command in
                    China and Indochina, and support for democratic government in China.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
